 # User Flow Tree
 
+## Engineering32 bounded browser handoff and original routine decisions (local, unaccepted)
+
+Browser startup/reload/direct entry → one exclusive Web Lock request, waiting at most three seconds → actual lock callback → private startup. A closing document may hand off during that bounded wait. A live holder beyond the bound leaves private access paused; close the holder, then explicitly Retry private app access. Pending document departure aborts only its request. Blur, route changes and unmount never release held authority. Unsupported/rejected coordination stays closed; query results never admit access.
+
+Routine records → review exact apply / clear / original recorded-use retraction → explicit confirm → encrypted owner/purpose/consent-epoch-bound original command preparation and authenticated readback → dispatch using the original live authority → ledger readback → separate exact acknowledgement. An interrupted preparation cannot dispatch; a lost result retains the original identity, time, predecessor, apply ordered source facts or exact original use/stream evidence. No command replays on startup.
+
+Routine records → Review saved routine decisions → confirmed collection / unavailable or unsupported refusal → Review saved decision → original facts and identity → Inspect original routine decision (read-only) → recorded_current / recorded_historical / conflict / not_found / unreadable. Not-found never proves failure. Explicit Retry this original routine decision reacquires current access and, for apply, a new approved in-memory source proof matching the original facts. Changed source/predecessor/target refuses. Acknowledge exact saved routine outcome is separate and rechecks the exact ledger under reservation before retiring only that recovery evidence. Close/Escape/navigation leaves unresolved evidence intact; canceled/stale callbacks cannot operate on a successor. Applying records no use; retraction preserves the original event. Withdrawal/full clearing remove the registered purpose key; export contains strict evidence, never live capabilities. Capacity refuses new preparation without purging unresolved work. All38/all18 remain UNACCEPTED; native/backend/scientific qualification remains absent.
+
 ## Engineering28 practice template library and navigation retirement (local, unaccepted)
 
 Critical professional web flow at 375×667 and 430×932: Practice templates → Load practice templates → real default503 refusal / admitted practice-only template history → New practice template → generic title and explicit ordered product roles → Review template revision → Return to draft / Save exact template revision → immutable readback → expand any dated prior revision → Revise → cancel or explicitly save a separate revision → Retire → Keep active / Confirm exact retirement → reload retained history. Unknown save retries the identical command; changed authority/history requires fresh review. Missing/corrupt history refuses instead of provisioning. Clear/background/session replacement invalidates pending work and captured controls. Keyboard focus moves to the new heading; title input keeps focus. No owner source or private client plan is imported, no owner record is changed, and no licence or provider admission is created. Exact role-to-bottle mapping, unshelved proposals, plan issuance from a template and original-owner application remain unavailable.
